I write `$S/evidence-wg-keepalive.md` from my own run output and the operator's pasted ping summary. Then the Agent tool, model Opus, in the background:

> Reply in English. You write documentation only; you decide nothing and touch no host.
> DIR: `<abs path>/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs`, branch `chore/wg-keepalive-docs`. Edit and commit here only; do not push.
> TASK: close the docs of T<n>, WireGuard keepalive relay, PR #165, merge `<sha>`.
> SOURCES: `<S>/evidence-wg-keepalive.md`, the diff of PR #165, the design and plan docs.
> WRITE: (1) living docs the change affects; (2) design and plan status "implemented — PR #165, `<sha>`"; (3) `projects/ccs/soul/<host>.md` for each ccs-it host the deploy changed, only what the evidence shows; mark anything else "not verified".
> RULES: no session links (`git grep -nE "code/session_[0-9A-Za-z]"` must be empty); docs files only.
> REPORT: files changed, head SHA, every claim you could not back with a source.

**4. Memory (Write tool)**

I write `advisor-tabs-four-roles.md` and its `MEMORY.md` pointer. It records that `prod-codex` and `prod-fable` design at stage 0, that `adv-codex` and `adv-fable` only vote, and that RDP audio entered stage 0 on 2026-09-28. I also save any trap from tonight's notes.

**5. Stage 0 tabs (foreground), then the skill check (background, one call per tab)**
```bash
mkdir -p "$S/brainstorm/rdp-audio" "$S/briefs"
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$S/brainstorm" --label prod-codex --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-codex --kind codex --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$S/brainstorm" --label prod-fable --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-fable --kind claude --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name prod-fable
```
```bash
# background, same call for prod-fable
herdr agent prompt prod-codex "Reply in English. Ignore any pre-filled text in your input box. Do no work yet. One line only: is the skill superpowers:brainstorming available in this session? Answer 'SKILL: yes' or 'SKILL: no'." --wait --timeout 120000; \
herdr agent read prod-codex --source recent-unwrapped --lines 50 > "$I/prod-codex.last"
```

